#X obj 30 90 env~;
#X obj 200 90 env~;
#X obj 30 140 f;
#X obj 200 140 f;
#X obj 30 180 i;
#X obj 200 180 i;
#X obj 450 40 loadbang;
#X obj 450 70 del 1000;
#X obj 450 100 t b b;
#X msg 560 130 \; pd dsp 1;
#X msg 450 130 1;
#X obj 450 170 metro 200;
#X obj 450 210 t b b b b b;
#X msg 450 260 sendtyped /oled/gShowInfoBar ii 3 0;
#X msg 450 300 sendtyped /oled/gClear ii 3 1;
#X msg 30 230 sendtyped /oled/gPrintln iiiiii 3 6 6 24 1 \$1;
#X msg 200 230 sendtyped /oled/gPrintln iiiiii 3 6 36 24 1 \$1;
#X msg 450 340 sendtyped /oled/gFlip i 3;
#X obj 30 420 s oscOut;
#X text 30 470 TOP number is adc~ 1 (tip / LEFT). BOTTOM number is
adc~ 2 (ring / RIGHT).;
#X text 30 510 env~ reports RMS in dB on a 0-100 scale: 100 is full
scale \, 0 is silence. Room noise reads somewhere in the 30s-40s \,
so a real signal should be clearly above that.;
